<title>NEW ZEALAND: TABLE-EVERGREEN YEAR LOSS NZ$202,000.</title>
<headline>TABLE-EVERGREEN YEAR LOSS NZ$202,000.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year result to June 30.</p>
<p>			   (million NZ$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net loss				0.20 vs 0.06</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			loss 0.1 vs 0.1 loss</p>
<p>    Turnover				 1.15 vs 2.55</p>
<p>    Pretax loss			    0.20 vs 0.06 loss</p>
<p>    Tax					 nil vs nil</p>
<p>    Shares outstanding		    131 vs 100</p>
<p>Note - Evergreen Forests Ltd is a plantation forest owner.</p>
<p>Evergreen said its forest holdings had almost doubled in the past 12 months. The outlook for log prices had improved, and substantial harvesting was expected to begin in 1998/99.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom +64 4 4714 272</p>
